WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.514
Where did that bar go?

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:06.936
Put your phone side-on to the bar, three to five metres back. Keep the whole lift in frame.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.765
Record in the app, or import a clip from Photos. Trim it down to the lift.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.776
Circle one weight plate on the first frame. That sets the scale.

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:20.831
Then it reads every frame on your phone. Your clip stays on your device.

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:26.608
Every clip gets a grade and a peak speed. Three analyses a month are free.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:31.525
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
